---@field model? string|distilled.Null LLM model for the first run when start_run is true, or for matching a pre-warmed run. Write-only.
---@field reasoning_effort? posthog.tasks.ReasoningEffortEnum|string|distilled.Null Reasoning effort for the first run when start_run is true, or for matching a pre-warmed run. Write-only. * `low` - low * `medium` - medium * `high` - high * `xhigh` - xhigh * `max` - max * `ultracode` - ultracode
